[I] Markdown parser with renderers and plugins

[T] A fast Python Markdown parser with renderers and plugins. Features
[T] include fast CommonMark-style parsing, explicity rule composition,
[T] mdast-compatible AST output, safe HTML defaults, streaming output,
[T] and pluggable renderers.

[U] https://mistune.lepture.com/

